OL,3,GNEWSA'Special' moment as three baby
OL,4,Amonkeys born at zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe stork has dropped off three newborn
OL,7,Fmonkeys at a zoo in Leicestershire.
OL,9,FTwycross Zoo has announced it is
OL,10,Fcelebrating the birth of a coppery titi
OL,11,Fmonkey along with cotton-top tamarin
OL,12,Ftwins, a critically-endangered species
OL,13,Fwith about 2,000 estimated to remain in
OL,14,Fthe wild.
OL,16,FPrimate curator Matt Ford said the zoo
OL,17,Fwas "thrilled" at what was "another
OL,18,Fmilestone in our conservation mission".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
